      "dateCreated": "2026-06-08",
      "educationalObjectives": [
        "Identify the three stages of Mars's retrograde episode: eastward drift, turnaround/loop, and resumption eastward.",
        "Describe retrograde as apparent motion relative to the starfield, not a reversal of Mars's true orbit direction."
      ],
      "instructions": [
        "Look at the labeled ecliptic constellations around you.",
        "Use Next to fast-forward time and watch Mars trace its loop.",
        "Observe the moment direction reverses."
